  "material_note": "Read off the sheets: branch, the antler-branches, bark; leaves, the cut-out sprigs on them, foliage; forestgost, the body of mossy stones with the crystal blade painted in, rock; forestgost_should, the stone shoulders, rock; prizm, mesh 3's pale-blue crystal, ice.",
