      "over": true,
      "pulse": [
        0.0,
        0.4
      ]
    }
  },
  "glow_from": "RenderAidaMonsterVisual's case MODEL_DEATH_RIDER (GMAida.cpp:1358-1376): meshes 0-2 plain; mesh 3 (prizm) under StreamMesh 0 with its U and V both slid by -(WorldTime % 10000) * 0.0006, 0.6 of the sheet a second, then again RENDER_TEXTURE | RENDER_BRIGHT | RENDER_CHROME at BodyLight 0.9. Ours: the lit ice body, and over it (`over`) the sheet sliding on both axes at MU's rate, added at a steady 0.4 (`pulse` [0, 0.4]). Added at 1, as a plain glow, the pale-blue sheet blew out white at noon.",
  "rules": {
    "drops": {
      "money_rate": 30,
      "max_plus": 3,
      "regen": 10
    },
    "resist": {
      "ice": 20,
      "poison": 20
    },
    "note": "Resistance: OpenMU S6 Maps/Aida.cs:396-398 writes 20/255 to poison, ice and fire, read as WebZen's raw 20 the way Tarkan's are (realm_tuning.h); fire is not carried. Drops: no MoneyRate or MaxItemLevel for Aida exists anywhere on disk, so Tarkan's 30 and 3, as docs/aida-port.md's decision 11 says; RegTime 10, OpenMU's RespawnDelay (Aida.cs:384)."
  },
